td.div:
Item 2 of the Schedule 13D is amended and restated in its entirety as follows

Each of the following is hereinafter individually referred to as a "Reporting Person" and collectively as the "Reporting Persons." This Schedule 13D is filed on behalf of:

Rivercrest Capital Partners LP ("RCP");
Rivercrest Capital GP LLC ("RCP GP");
Rivercrest Capital Partners II LP ("RCP II");
Rivercrest Capital GP II, LLC ("RCP II GP");
Cupola Royalty Direct LLC ("Cupola"); and
Rivercrest Cupola LLC  ("Cupola GP").

Robert D. Ravnaas, T. Scott Martin and R. Davis Ravnaas are the managing members of RCP GP and Cupola GP. Robert D. Ravnaas, T. Scott Martin, R. Davis Ravnaas and Matthew Daly (collectively, the "Covered Individuals") are the managing members of RCP II GP.
